SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

The independent delimiter-stack emphasis implementation and its integration
were written for this modified fork and remain covered by the copyright notice
below.

The source includes independently authored parser refinements for multiline
HTML tags and balanced punctuation in bare URL recognition.

The current independent modifications also include block/list continuation,
reference-link normalization, and raw-tag attribute validation.

The independently written parser and driver modifications in this repository,
including block, list, fence, link, and inline handling, are Copyright (c) 2026
vora95 and contributors and are licensed under these same terms.

This project includes independently written modifications to an implementation
informed by marked. See NOTICE for the upstream project's attribution and
license information.

